id: pm-review-native-folders
title: Adopt native custom-type folders in changelog generation
description: "Adapt PR #19 to pm-changelog native registered folder metadata, superseding the workaround delivered by pm-review-changelog-links. Remove canonicalFindingLinks, preserve branch-file checks and output behaviors, and verify a behavioral revert with unchanged release gates."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-19T12:28:52.233Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-19T12:32:16.140Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
parent: pm-review-epic
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-19T12:29:02.374Z",codex-agent,"Merged origin/main into the Dependabot branch without conflicts. Registry versions checked: pm-changelog 2026.10.19-1 is newer than the proposed 2026.10.16 and is now pinned; pm-cli latest is 2026.10.19, with this repo retaining the Dependabot-owned 2026.10.15 pin. Inspecting upstream readPmItems and folder metadata before choosing the smallest supported integration."
  "2026-10-19T12:29:38.728Z",codex-agent,"Upstream docs/usage.md (Registered item folders and link checks) documents readPmItems as the native tracker reader and itemFolder metadata for JSON input. The existing CLI already uses readPmItems; remove the output rewrite and use that path directly. Update JSON behavior fixtures to retain readPmItems metadata. Keep missing-file refusal, alternate bases, large output, and step summaries. Local health also reports pm-github host-version skew from machine extension discovery; preserve dependency scope and verify tracker health in an isolated HOME and fresh clone."
  "2026-10-19T12:32:16.140Z",codex-agent,"Regression proof: after adapting the tests, node --test test/changelog.test.ts passed 5/5 (baseline before adaptation: 1 passed, 4 failed). Temporarily reverted only pm-changelog resolveItemFolder to built-in folders plus the old lowercase-type pluralization, leaving wrapper/tests unchanged. node --test --test-name-pattern=^changelog\\ resolves\\ registered test/changelog.test.ts exited 1, with the link test refusing reviewfindings/sample-gh-685da68fb5e0aeb61aa0b653.toon because no branch file exists. Restored the installed resolver byte-for-byte. The generated prepare-merge-driver .gitattributes change uses merge=text for extension assets under the pinned toolchain. Isolated-HOME strict tracker health passes; no merge receipts required for the workflow-only main merge."
